ght="28" rx="5" fill="#16a34a"/><text x="386.5" y="220.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">G</text><line x1="386.5" y1="86" x2="386.5" y2="122" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/><line x1="386.5" y1="154" x2="386.5" y2="204" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="402" y="56" width="25" height="28" rx="5" fill="#dc2626"/><text x="414.5" y="70.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">T</text><rect x="402" y="124" width="25" height="28" rx="5" fill="#2563eb"/><text x="414.5" y="138.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">A</text><rect x="402" y="206" width="25" height="28" rx="5" fill="#dc2626"/><text x="414.5" y="220.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">U</text><line x1="414.5" y1="86" x2="414.5" y2="122" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/><line x1="414.5" y1="154" x2="414.5" y2="204" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="430" y="56" width="25" height="28" rx="5" fill="#16a34a"/><text x="442.5" y="70.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">G</text><rect x="430" y="124" width="25" height="28" rx="5" fill="#d97706"/><text x="442.5" y="138.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">C</text><rect x="430" y="206" width="25" height="28" rx="5" fill="#16a34a"/><text x="442.5" y="220.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">G</text><line x1="442.5" y1="86" x2="442.5" y2="122" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/><line x1="442.5" y1="154" x2="442.5" y2="204" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="458" y="56" width="25" height="28" rx="5" fill="#2563eb"/><text x="470.5" y="70.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">A</text><rect x="458" y="124" width="25" height="28" rx="5" fill="#dc2626"/><text x="470.5" y="138.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">T</text><rect x="458" y="206" width="25" height="28" rx="5" fill="#2563eb"/><text x="470.5" y="220.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">A</text><line x1="470.5" y1="86" x2="470.5" y2="122" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/><line x1="470.5" y1="154" x2="470.5" y2="204" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="14" y="284" font-family="Arial" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#334155">Amino acids</text><path d="M150 238 v8 h81 v-8" fill="none" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="150" y="252" width="81" height="30" rx="6" fill="#fee2e2" stroke="#b91c1c" stroke-width="2"/><text x="190.5" y="267.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#7f1d1d">Met</text><path d="M234 238 v8 h81 v-8" fill="none" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="234" y="252" width="81" height="30" rx="6" fill="#fee2e2" stroke="#b91c1c" stroke-width="2"/><text x="274.5" y="267.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#7f1d1d">Pro</text><path d="M318 238 v8 h81 v-8" fill="none" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="318" y="252" width="81" height="30" rx="6" fill="#fee2e2" stroke="#b91c1c" stroke-width="2"/><text x="358.5" y="267.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#7f1d1d">Lys</text><path d="M402 238 v8 h81 v-8" fill="none" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="402" y="252" width="81" height="30" rx="6" fill="#fecaca" stroke="#b91c1c" stroke-width="2"/><text x="442.5" y="267.5" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#7f1d1d">Stop</text></svg>', 'The mRNA is complementary to the template: AUG CCU AAG UGA. AUG is the start codon (Met), CCU codes for Pro, AAG for Lys and UGA is a stop codon, so translation ends there and the polypeptide is Met-Pro-Lys.', 'D');
